ple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[35,25,75,78,72,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[35,25,75,78,72,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[35,25,75,78,72,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[35,25,75,78,72,65],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"98","reputation":"9650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,25,75,78,72,65],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"98","reputation":"9650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"出身名门泰山羊氏，东汉悬鱼太守羊续的幼子，曹魏名将羊祜的叔父。其本人官至太常（九卿之一，掌宗庙礼仪），是曹魏时期的重要官员。其最重要的身份之一，是娶了曹魏卫尉辛毗之女、以聪朗有才鉴闻名后世的才女辛宪英为妻。","tc":"出身名門泰山羊氏，東漢懸魚太守羊續的幼子，曹魏名將羊祜的叔父。其本人官至太常（九卿之一，掌宗廟禮儀），是曹魏時期的重要官員。其最重要的身份之一，是娶了曹魏衛尉辛毗之女、以聰朗有才鑒聞名后世的才女辛憲英為妻。","en":"Born into the illustrious Yang clan of Taishan, he was the youngest son of Yang Xu—the Eastern Han Governor renowned for hanging the gifted fish—and the uncle of famed Cao Wei general Yang Hu. He himself rose to Undersecretary (one of the Nine Ministers, in charge of ancestral temple rituals) and was an important official of Cao Wei. One of his most notable distinctions was marrying Xin Xianying, daughter of Cao Wei Guard Officer Xin Pi, who was celebrated by later generations for her keen intellect and insightful judgment.","jp":"名門・泰山羊氏の出身。東漢の「懸魚太守」羊続の末子であり、曹魏の名将・羊祜の叔父。自身も官位は太常（九卿の一つ、宗廟の礼儀を司る）にまで上り詰め、曹魏の重臣となった。またその最も重要な一面として、曹魏の衛尉・辛毗の娘であり、聡明で見識が高いことで後世に名を残した才女・辛憲英を妻に迎えたことが挙げられる。","kr":"태산 양씨 명문 출신으로, 동한의 '현어태수' 양속의 막내아들이자 조위 명장 양호의 숙부이다. 관직은 태상(구경 중 하나로, 종묘의 예법을 관장)에 이르러 조위 시기의 주요 관원으로 활약했다. 가장 널리 알려진 이력 중 하나는 조위 위위 신비의 딸이자 총명하고 뛰어난 안목으로 후세에 이름을 떨친 재녀 신헌영을 아내로 맞이한 것이다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1037715","remark":"","surname":"羊","surnameTc":"羊","surnameEn":"Yang","surnameJp":"羊","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"耽","nameTc":"耽","nameEn":"Dan","nameJp":"耽","nameKr":"탐","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"羊耽","power":"WJ10058","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"194","city":"CS1001","gender":"0","rule":"35","force":"25","wise":"75","politics":"78","charm":"72","will":"65","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"7/7/7/7/7/73/34/7","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1002405","warSoulPoint":"2600","battleSoulPoint":"600","debateSoulPoint":"5600","strategy"